2980475.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-judge-blocks-trump-law-cutting-medicaid-sides-with-planned-parenthood-cites-unplanned-pregnancy-spike/articleshow/122980475.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-judge-blocks-trump-law-cutting-medicaid-sides-with-planned-parenthood-cites-unplanned-pregnancy-spike/articleshow/122980475.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T22:10:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122980479,imgsize-1189397.cms"/></item><item><title>‘They are all crying’: Father of NYPD officer killed in Manhattan shooting suffers stroke; pregnant wife hospitalised</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122980914.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/they-are-all-crying-father-of-nypd-officer-killed-in-manhattan-shooting-suffers-stroke-pregnant-wife-hospitalised/articleshow/122980914.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/they-are-all-crying-father-of-nypd-officer-killed-in-manhattan-shooting-suffers-stroke-pregnant-wife-hospitalised/articleshow/122980914.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T22:38:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122980906,imgsize-391620.cms"/></item><item><title>Gaza crisis: UK to recognise Palestinian state if Israel fails to act on ceasefire</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122980560.cms" /&gt;British Prime Minister Keir Starmer announced the UK might recognise Palestine at the UN in September if Israel doesn't agree to a Gaza ceasefire and commit to a lasting peace. This decision follows mounting international pressure, including France's similar move. Starmer's plan, presented to President Trump, is conditional, urging Israel to halt hostilities and pursue a two-state solution, excluding Hamas.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/gaza-crisis-uk-to-recognise-palestinian-state-if-israel-fails-to-act-on-ceasefire-pm-keir-starmer-terms-statehood-as-inalienable-right/articleshow/122980560.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/gaza-crisis-uk-to-recognise-palestinian-state-if-israel-fails-to-act-on-ceasefire-pm-keir-starmer-terms-statehood-as-inalienable-right/articleshow/122980560.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T22:14:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122980557,imgsize-756437.cms"/></item><item><title>What is CTE? Why this brain disease is behind Manhattan shooting by Shane Tamura</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122980157.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-is-cte-why-this-brain-disease-is-behind-manhattan-shooting-by-shane-tamura/articleshow/122980157.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-is-cte-why-this-brain-disease-is-behind-manhattan-shooting-by-shane-tamura/articleshow/122980157.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T21:39:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122980139,imgsize-46890.cms"/></item><item><title>'Genocide in Gaza': Marjorie Taylor Greene becomes first Republican in Congress to use term; rebukes GOP colleague’s starvation comment</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122979901.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/genocide-in-gaza-marjorie-taylor-greene-becomes-first-republican-in-congress-to-use-term-rebukes-gop-colleagues-starvation-comment/articleshow/122979901.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/genocide-in-gaza-marjorie-taylor-greene-becomes-first-republican-in-congress-to-use-term-rebukes-gop-colleagues-starvation-comment/articleshow/122979901.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T21:21:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122979920,imgsize-890384.cms"/></item><item><title>'Senseless act of violence': Trump condemns Manhattan mass shooting that left five dead; hails NYPD officer for 'sacrifice'</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122979232.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/senseless-act-of-violence-trump-condemns-manhattan-mass-shooting-that-left-five-dead-hails-nypd-officer-for-sacrifice/articleshow/122979232.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/senseless-act-of-violence-trump-condemns-manhattan-mass-shooting-that-left-five-dead-hails-nypd-officer-for-sacrifice/articleshow/122979232.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T20:38:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122979318,imgsize-601870.cms"/></item><item><title>What is Leqembi? The first Alzheimer’s treatment approved today in Saudi Arabia</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122978567.cms" /&gt;Saudi Arabia’s SFDA has approved Leqembi (lecanemab), the Kingdom’s first Alzheimer’s treatment. This innovative drug slows disease progression by targeting beta-amyloid plaques, protein clumps that disrupt brain cell communication. Approved for patients with mild symptoms and specific genetic profiles, Leqembi requires careful monitoring to manage side effects, marking a major step forward in Alzheimer’s care through advanced biotechnology.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/what-is-leqembi-the-first-alzheimers-treatment-approved-today-in-saudi-arabia/articleshow/122978567.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/what-is-leqembi-the-first-alzheimers-treatment-approved-today-in-saudi-arabia/articleshow/122978567.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-29T21:31:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122980002,imgsize-1279281.cms"/></item></channel></rss>